255	// Which generation engine to use.
256	//   api (default) — metered Anthropic API via ANTHROPIC_API_KEY. Real cost,
257	//                   real usage telemetry, real credit charges.
258	//   sdk           — Claude Agent SDK on this machine's `claude setup-token`
259	//                   subscription login. No metered spend, so no cost data and
260	//                   0 credits charged. See lib/agent-sdk.ts for the caveats.
